  <div class="id"><img class="avatar" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Nicole Barrera Wong" width="96" height="96"><div>
  <h1>Nicole Barrera Wong</h1>
  <p class="role"><span lang="en">Global Growth Marketing Specialist at ACCIONA, Madrid</span><span lang="es">Global Growth Marketing Specialist en ACCIONA, Madrid</span></p>
  <p class="tagline"><span lang="en">I connect web, content, search and CRM: from the moment someone finds the brand to the moment they become a contact.</span><span lang="es">Conecto web, contenido, búsqueda y CRM: desde que alguien encuentra la marca hasta que se convierte en contacto.</span></p>
  <div class="cta"><a class="btn primary" href="mailto:nicolebarrera.w@gmail.com"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></svg><span lang="en">Contact</span><span lang="es">Contactar</span></a><a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicole-barrera-wong/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><path d="M8 10v7M8 7v.01M12 17v-4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v4M12 10v7"/></svg>LinkedIn</a><button type="button" class="btn" id="cvbtn" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"/></svg><span lang="en">Download CV</span><span lang="es">Descargar CV</span></button><span class="langs"><span lang="en">English and Spanish</span><span lang="es">Español e inglés</span></span></div>
