<main>
<section id="overview" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t-overview">
<div lang="en">
  <p class="lead">Digital marketing specialist with seven years of experience in web management, content, SEO, GEO and CRM.</p>
  <p>I joined ACCIONA’s digital marketing team in 2019 and currently work as Global Growth Marketing Specialist. My remit spans the corporate and country websites, the content of acciona.com, organic visibility in search engines and AI assistants, and CRM and email marketing in HubSpot.</p>
  <h3>What I bring</h3>
  <div class="principles"><div><strong>End-to-end view</strong><p>I work across every stage, from the website and its content to lead capture and CRM, so I can see where value is lost between them.</p></div><div><strong>Bridge between business and technology</strong><p>I turn business needs into requirements for the design and development partners, and explain technical decisions in business terms.</p></div><div><strong>Applied AI</strong><p>I put AI into practice: visibility in AI search, prerendering for AI crawlers and automated workflows for the team.</p></div><div><strong>Multi-market experience</strong><p>I work in Spanish and English with teams in several countries and act as their point of reference for everything related to the web.</p></div></div>
  <h3>An integrated view</h3>
  <p>Working across all of these areas allows me to follow the full user journey, from the first visit to conversion into a contact, and to identify where it can be improved.</p>
