  <h4 class="sub">Performance reporting</h4>
  <p>I prepare monthly performance reports for our websites, combining cookieless analytics, GA4, Search Console and HubSpot, and investigate anomalies. Cookieless analytics lets us measure with first-party data, without relying on third-party cookies. A recent traffic spike, for example, was traced to a single low-quality campaign. Looker Studio dashboards and Meltwater, which we use to monitor both media and AI, complete the picture.</p>
